WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.532
UV light hits DNA.

00:00:02.066 --> 00:00:03.737
A neighboring C and T get bonded

00:00:03.761 --> 00:00:04.248
together.

00:00:04.643 --> 00:00:06.141
That makes a bulge in the backbone.

00:00:06.988 --> 00:00:08.799
Repair proteins recognize the bulge.

00:00:08.985 --> 00:00:10.692
They cut the backbone on both sides.

00:00:11.029 --> 00:00:12.631
They remove the damaged bases.

00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:14.639
New bases fill the gap.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.380
Then the backbone is sealed again.

00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:17.890
Think of a road crew fixing a

00:00:17.925 --> 00:00:18.401
pothole.

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:20.746
Recognize, cut, replace, reseal.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.673
Now try the question again.
